  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of WASH, Shelter and life-saving assistance for older persons in Marib, Yemen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project intends to address the acute needs of the most vulnerable IDPs &amp; persons affected by this protracted crisis giving a special focus on older people &amp; people with special needs at Marib city district - Marib Gov, through the provision of comprehensive package of WASH, shelter &amp; protection complementary interventions.</narrative>
